sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant S as STEGO
  participant A as AUTH
  U->>S: POST /steganography/analyze + Bearer JWT
  S->>A: POST /internal/authorization/check (HMAC, subject_token)
  A->>A: Valida JWT, usuario activo, tokenVersion y roles en BD
  A-->>S: allowed / scope / reason
  alt allowed = true
    S->>S: Valida imagen, analiza, persiste, aplica política
    S-->>U: 200 + resultado
  else allowed = false
    S-->>U: 403
  else AUTH no disponible
    S-->>U: 503 (sin análisis)
  end
